{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/c73e1a2b491ea5715a3c7abc3cf907bd.avif?t=1752218578\" /></div> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Royal Jest</strong> is the world's first ever theatrically performed<strong>\u00a0adventure</strong> game! <strong>Play</strong> as our hero, a humble peasant boy, as he receives a once-in-a-lifetime invitation to the opulent royal palace. The royal family, eager to refresh their\u00a0incestuous lineage, seeks a worthy suitor for the Princess...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafted with charming, hand-cut papercraft aesthetics, this unique adventure blends <strong>dark humor</strong>, stage-inspired gameplay, and theatrical set pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bizarre and eccentric characters and animations!</strong> Encounter a wild cast of quirky characters brought to life with vibrant, offbeat animations that burst with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A never ending barrage of fully scripted humor!</strong> Dive into a relentless stream of witty dialogue and absurd situations that keep the laughs coming from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of theatrical set pieces to discover and explore!</strong> Uncover a variety of dynamic, stage-inspired environments filled with interactive elements and hidden surprises waiting to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An upbeat original soundtrack!</strong> Groove to a lively, custom-composed soundtrack that perfectly complements the game\u2019s theatrical vibe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2026and fully player controlled curtains!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/1dd6243c7c52138b26092735f00b13de.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/1dd6243c7c52138b26092735f00b13de.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/1dd6243c7c52138b26092735f00b13de.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Starring</strong> our protagonist - the peasant boy hoping to trade his pitchfork for a royal scepter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/28ee054956b497746eebfa41131e6465.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/28ee054956b497746eebfa41131e6465.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/28ee054956b497746eebfa41131e6465.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-starring <strong>Tony</strong>, the flamboyant knight who slays with style and a wink, all while dodging questions about his private life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f00bbe52239c96a5ab44c896a2bf4ac4.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f00bbe52239c96a5ab44c896a2bf4ac4.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f00bbe52239c96a5ab44c896a2bf4ac4.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026facing off all manner of walking <strong>clich\u00e9s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/37ee2181ade31ae51ad2062068bbf00e.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/37ee2181ade31ae51ad2062068bbf00e.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/37ee2181ade31ae51ad2062068bbf00e.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It ain't curtains till the <strong>fat lady</strong> belches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854960?t=1752218578","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/902b7b18b3a9fdc281143a63ee7cefcb9b5b067c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752218578","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/cd335196e9fd423d42f3b1043cfe59f3d3c1e222/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752218578","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/cd335196e9fd423d42f3b1043cfe59f3d3c1e222/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752218578","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/c73e1a2b491ea5715a3c7abc3cf907bd.avif?t=1752218578\" /></div> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Royal Jest</strong> is the world's first ever theatrically performed<strong>\u00a0adventure</strong> game! <strong>Play</strong> as our hero, a humble peasant boy, as he receives a once-in-a-lifetime invitation to the opulent royal palace. The royal family, eager to refresh their\u00a0incestuous lineage, seeks a worthy suitor for the Princess...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafted with charming, hand-cut papercraft aesthetics, this unique adventure blends <strong>dark humor</strong>, stage-inspired gameplay, and theatrical set pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bizarre and eccentric characters and animations!</strong> Encounter a wild cast of quirky characters brought to life with vibrant, offbeat animations that burst with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A never ending barrage of fully scripted humor!</strong> Dive into a relentless stream of witty dialogue and absurd situations that keep the laughs coming from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of theatrical set pieces to discover and explore!</strong> Uncover a variety of dynamic, stage-inspired environments filled with interactive elements and hidden surprises waiting to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An upbeat original soundtrack!</strong> Groove to a lively, custom-composed soundtrack that perfectly complements the game\u2019s theatrical vibe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2026and fully player controlled curtains!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/1dd6243c7c52138b26092735f00b13de.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/1dd6243c7c52138b26092735f00b13de.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/1dd6243c7c52138b26092735f00b13de.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Starring</strong> our protagonist - the peasant boy hoping to trade his pitchfork for a royal scepter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/28ee054956b497746eebfa41131e6465.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/28ee054956b497746eebfa41131e6465.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/28ee054956b497746eebfa41131e6465.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-starring <strong>Tony</strong>, the flamboyant knight who slays with style and a wink, all while dodging questions about his private life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f00bbe52239c96a5ab44c896a2bf4ac4.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f00bbe52239c96a5ab44c896a2bf4ac4.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f00bbe52239c96a5ab44c896a2bf4ac4.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026facing off all manner of walking <strong>clich\u00e9s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/37ee2181ade31ae51ad2062068bbf00e.poster.avif?t=1752218578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/37ee2181ade31ae51ad2062068bbf00e.webm?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/37ee2181ade31ae51ad2062068bbf00e.mp4?t=1752218578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It ain't curtains till the <strong>fat lady</strong> belches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Theatre House Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/8bb037d3185814001bacf9c35b2e4aa290ccdbfc/header.jpg?t=1752218578","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257164163,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164163/movie480.mp4?t=1751990246","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164163/movie_max.mp4?t=1751990246"},"name":"Royal Jest Wishlist Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164163/1d9356f84ea1eda9a08f6c0405e66dcb52137562/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751990246","webm":{"48